Rename the morse module to mm6108_sdio to coexist with the mm8108 driver

Both mm6108-driver and mm8108-driver build a module named morse.ko, so the
two kernel packages clash on /lib/modules/<ver>/morse.ko and cannot be
installed into the same rootfs. Rename this (mm6108) build's module to
mm6108_sdio.ko, following Gateworks morse_driver commit 1e008f2d17a2
("wifi: morse: rename to mm6108_sdio").

The dot11ah.ko module is intentionally NOT packaged from this tree; the
shared kmod-dot11ah package from mm8108-driver provides it (mm6108's
modpost already links against mm8108-driver.symvers).

